{"from":"1:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"2PE.1.1\">1</ref> Confirming them in hope of the increase of God's graces,<br/><ref to=\"2PE.1.5\">5</ref> he exhorts them, by faith, and good works, to make their calling sure;<br/><ref to=\"2PE.1.12\">12</ref> whereof he is careful to remind them, knowing that his death is at hand;<br/><ref to=\"2PE.1.16\">16</ref> and warns them to be constant in the faith of Christ, who is the true Son of God, by the eyewitness of the apostles beholding his majesty, and by the testimony of the Father, and the prophets.<br/><br/><br/>Simon. or, Symeon.<br/><ref to=\"ACT.15.14\">Ac 15:14</ref><br/>Peter.<br/><ref to=\"MAT.4.18 MAT.10.2 LUK.22.31-LUK.22.34 JHN.1.42 JHN.21.15-JHN.21.17 1PE.1.1\">Mt 4:18; 10:2; Lu 22:31-34; Joh 1:42; 21:15-17; 1Pe 1:1</ref><br/>a servant.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.12.26 ROM.1.1\">Joh 12:26; Ro 1:1</ref><br/>an apostle.<br/><ref to=\"LUK.11.49 JHN.20.21 1CO.9.1 1CO.15.9 GAL.2.8 EPH.3.5 EPH.4.11 1PE.5.1\">Lu 11:49; Joh 20:21; 1Co 9:1; 15:9; Ga 2:8; Eph 3:5; 4:11; 1Pe 5:1</ref><br/>have.<br/><ref to=\"2PE.1.4 ACT.15.8 ACT.15.9 ROM.1.12 2CO.4.13 EPH.4.5 PHP.1.29 2TI.1.5\">4; Ac 15:8,9; Ro 1:12; 2Co 4:13; Eph 4:5; Php 1:29; 2Ti 1:5</ref><br/><ref to=\"TIT.1.1 TIT.1.4 1PE.1.7 1PE.2.7\">Tit 1:1,4; 1Pe 1:7; 2:7</ref><br/>through.<br/><ref to=\"JER.33.16 ROM.1.17 ROM.3.21-ROM.3.26 1CO.1.30 2CO.5.21 PHP.3.9\">Jer 33:16; Ro 1:17; 3:21-26; 1Co 1:30; 2Co 5:21; Php 3:9</ref><br/>of God and our Saviour. Gr. of our God and Saviour.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.12.2 LUK.1.47 TIT.2.13\">Isa 12:2; Lu 1:47; Tit 2:13</ref></p>"}
